<title>UK: London silver fixes sharply up, breaks 500 cents.</title>
<headline>London silver fixes sharply up, breaks 500 cents.</headline>
<text>
<p>SILVER - Fixed at 503.00 cents vs 494.10 cents previously. Boosted by fund short covering in New York and some follow through later. At resistance.</p>
<p>GOLD - Firmer with silver at $356.70/$357.20, vs $354.45/$354.95. Option related buying.</p>
<p>PLATINUM - Just up at $360.00/$361.00, up $0.25.</p>
<p>PALLADIUM - Off $0.50 at $122.50/$123.50.</p>
</text>
